  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance GGIA - Guyana and Suriname</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Overall objective&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To contribute to a diversified and sustainable Guyanese and Surinamese economy, within the framework of the Global Gateway Investment Agenda, ensuring alignment with the country&apos;s strategic priorities and fostering inclusive and sustainable development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Specific objectives&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Provide targeted technical assistance in priority areas of economic and political governance to strengthen institutional capacities and policy frameworks in Guyana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhance evidence-based policy dialogue and reform processes through the organisation of events, conferences, analytical studies, fellowships, and exchange platforms that foster multi-stakeholder engagement between government institutions, civil society, and development partners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Prepare the ground for Global Gateway and Team Europe initiatives, by fostering dialogue and raise awareness of key stakeholders and make sure objectives, priorities and methodologies are well received.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Position the interests of the Guyanese, Surinamese and EU private sector within the framework of the Global Gateway Investment Agenda for Guyana and Suriname, notably by conducting feasibility studies, organizing sectoral GGIA missions to and from the EU, hosting study tours, and facilitating business forums.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Promote a regulatory and institutional framework that favours sustainable investment in the key sectors of the Global Gateway Investment Agenda for Guyana and Suriname.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;6.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Propose options for follow up initiatives to replicate, scale up, and possibly institutionalize, the regular precondition of economic cooperation between the EU ant the countries concerned and the presence of EU business in the region.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
